OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters spend night tackling
OL,4,AGlasgow scrap yard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent the night
OL,7,Ftackling a major blaze at a scrap yard
OL,8,Fin Glasgow.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(SFRS) said the alarm was raised at the
OL,12,Fbusiness on South Street, in the
OL,13,FScotstoun area of the city, at about
OL,14,F23:23 on Friday.
OL,16,FA SFRS spokesperson said nine fire
OL,17,Fappliances, two high reach appliances
OL,18,Fand specialist resources responded to
OL,19,Fthe incident.
OL,21,FNo casualties were reported.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
